          },
          "original_img_height": 793,
          "original_img_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOOTS9RWQAAuoVV.jpg",
          "original_img_width": 1983
        },
        "media_key": "3_2081669406669553664"
      },
      "content": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "68sdf",
            "text": "每天都有大量的邮件需要处理，但是感觉很低效，前段时间有一周，我做了一下统计：把每天处理邮件的时间记录了一下。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "eh9l4",
            "text": "我连续记录了五个工作日。平均每天处理 36 封邮件，真正输入回复约 22 分钟；筛选、补上下文、翻译和窗口切换合计接近 50 分钟。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "8q541",
            "text": "这一周我把整个流程重新拆了一遍，用网易邮箱大师的 AI 助理搭了条工作流出来。这篇就完整拆解一下它是怎么跑的。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 0,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4vu55",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "b9r10",
            "text": "先交代下背景。我原来处理邮件的工作流是这样的：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 49,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "17nrd",
            "text": "打开邮箱 → 从上往下扫标题 → 挨个点开读 → 判断要不要回 → 写回复 → 英文的另开翻译窗口",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6e6o3",
            "text": "麻烦不在「写」本身——真正敲字那二十来分钟反而是最省心的。耗时间的是「写之前」和「写之后」这两头:",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "eo357",
            "text": "写之前：几十封未读堆在那儿，先得决定「先看哪封」；有些长邮件还得读到一半，才发现跟自己没关系。",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "fkp9f",
            "text": "写之后：英文回复先在邮箱起个草，复制到翻译工具，改完再粘回来，一封信来回切三四次窗口。",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6sdn0",
            "text": "所以我一直想要的是这么个东西：打开邮箱 → 自动把重要的挑出来 → 长的先给我个摘要 → 要回的直接在原邮件上生成回复 → 英文的顺手优化掉。中间不用跳出去。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "aomgh",
            "text": "这两天，这条流水线基本被我跑通了。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "d7ou3",
            "text": "拆解：这个工作流是怎么跑的",
            "type": "header-one"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 1,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 8
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6hqo",
            "text": "用到的东西很简单👇",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 3,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              },
              {
                "length": 6,
                "offset": 4,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "9911h",
            "text": "APP：网易邮箱大师",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 2,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              },
              {
                "length": 6,
                "offset": 11,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "3jop8",
            "text": "入口：底部导航栏 → AI 助理，另外单独的邮件里也有AI助理的入口",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 2,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "2lv7h",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 5,
                "offset": 22,
                "style": "Bold"
              },
              {
                "length": 8,
                "offset": 32,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "glk5",
            "text": "打开网易邮箱大师 APP，点击底部导航栏的 AI 助理，再点开 全部 AI 功能。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 22,
                "offset": 47,
                "style": "Bold"
              },
              {
                "length": 7,
                "offset": 77,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "fk990",
            "text": "展开后功能挺多的，分了邮件、文件、外文几组。我不打算挨个介绍——真正串进我这条工作流的就四个：整理最近邮件、总结邮件、回复邮件、文本优化，外加处理外文时的翻译和英文优化。下面只讲这几个。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 3,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4uopm",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 4,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7e9gm",
            "text": "📥 第一步：第一件事，跑「整理最近邮件」",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3s9h0",
            "text": "我喜欢给出明确的指示，让它帮我梳理收件箱最近 30 封的邮件，把重要邮件提出来，把垃圾邮件标识出来",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 5,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4gb1r",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 12,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "6qdmo",
            "text": "这一步是整个工作流的开始，也是我觉得省时间最明显的一步。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4lin3",
            "text": "跑完之后，收件箱不再是一堆未读，而是一份已经排好优先级的清单。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 6,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "f0h9",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 4,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "fljq3",
            "text": "实操建议：把它固定在每天开工的第一个动作，别等到收件箱失控了才想起来跑。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 7,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "67u88",
            "text": "📄 第二步：先「总结邮件」，再决定读不读",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6d4p0",
            "text": "清单出来后，我不会把所有邮件都点开，而是先对高、中优先级的邮件调用「总结邮件」，用摘要判断是否值得现在读全文。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 8,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "9rrcr",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 25,
                "offset": 14,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "7q9lo",
            "text": "这里有个顺序问题，我踩过坑：我以前的用法是读完再总结，留个记录，其实没什么用。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "9l5dk",
            "text": "后来改成先总结、再决定要不要展开，体感完全不一样。同一个功能，放在读之前和读之后，省下来的时间差很多。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7tq13",
            "text": "拿到摘要之后，我一般直接分三堆：现在处理、丢进待办、不用管。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 9,
                "length": 2,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "b488a",
            "text": "✍️ 第三步：AI助手回邮件",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4l6o5",
            "text": "这一步原来最烦的其实是搬运——把原文复制出去，让别的AI工具看见，生成完再粘回来。单次不到一分钟，但是次数太多了，也挺麻烦的。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 4,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "9l1fb",
            "text": "回复邮件 是接着原邮件走的，操作是这样：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3mm94",
            "text": "点击左下角的AI助理图标",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 10,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "ab5sh",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 11,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "118ot",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "1ggsq",
            "text": "输入你要回复的内容（写个大意就行，不用写全）；",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 2,
                "offset": 2,
                "style": "Bold"
              },
              {
                "length": 2,
                "offset": 5,
                "style": "Bold"
              },
              {
                "length": 2,
                "offset": 8,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "cdqe8",
            "text": "选择语气、长度、语言；",
            "type": "ordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "fl1gh",
            "text": "一键生成回复。",
            "type": "ordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 12,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "2kuit",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "fu8o",
            "text": "不用跳出去这件事，对我来说实在太方便啦。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 4,
                "offset": 17,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "elmat",
            "text": "如果是从零起草的新邮件，对应的是 撰写邮件，同样支持自定义语气、长度和语言。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 13,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "c9vb0",
            "text": "✨ 第四步：发之前过一道「文本优化」",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "8oqe9",
            "text": "生成完别急着发。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 4,
                "offset": 16,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "77kjr",
            "text": "写得急的时候语气容易硬，点一下 文本优化，它会把邮件文案润色一遍，提升沟通质感。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 14,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "b9u1j",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "8cbg1",
            "text": "我一般在两种情况下会加这一步：一是自己写得太快措辞偏生硬，二是收件人层级比较高或者不太熟。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "ees5r",
            "text": "如果你要处理外文邮件",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "bpcn5",
            "text": "有对外沟通场景的话，邮件里可以一键翻译，非常方便，再也不用复制到外面的翻译软件了。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 15,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "88ah3",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "a03es",
            "text": "在处理非常重要的英文邮件的时候，很多时候，不是简单的翻译一下就完了，那这个时候，「英文优化」这个功能就可以派上用场了。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 16,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "fmcp4",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "bsrpn",
            "text": "小结",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7nrbn",
            "text": "回头看，这条流程其实没有多复杂：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 27,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "c8d18",
            "text": "整理最近邮件 → 总结邮件 → 回复邮件 → 文本优化",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 6,
                "offset": 8,
                "style": "Bold"
              },
              {
                "length": 5,
                "offset": 16,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "2kcv9",
            "text": "这些操作都可以在网易邮箱大师的 AI 助理里完成。如果是外文邮件，还可以直接在邮件里翻译；遇到比较重要的英文沟通，再用「英文优化」把措辞过一遍。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "d5cql",
            "text": "对我来说，省下来的时间主要不在“写回复”这一步，而在写之前的筛选和判断，以及写之后来回切换翻译、润色工具的过程。以前处理邮件时，总要先把收件箱从头扫一遍，再在邮箱、翻译工具和 AI 之间来回搬内容；现在这几个动作都能在邮箱里完成，流程顺很多。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "a5m2g",
            "text": "这次最意外的收获，是把「总结邮件」放到了读邮件之前。以前我读完再总结，只是留下一份记录；现在先看摘要，再决定要不要展开全文，很多低优先级邮件就不用花时间细读了。功能没变，只是换了个顺序，效果却差很多。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5ofl1",
            "text": "这条流程不一定适合每个人。你可以先观察几天：自己处理邮件时，时间到底花在哪一步？是筛选、理解上下文、起草回复，还是外文沟通？找准最卡的环节，再用工具把它接进去，通常比一口气试很多功能更有效。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          }
        ],
